---
import AboutPhoto from '../assets/about-photo.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Dondi"
	pubDate={new Date()}
	heroImage={AboutPhoto}
	size="small"
	tags={[]}
>
	<p>
		Materials engineering student by day, currently more interested in <em>why a four-legged gait looks wrong?</em>
	</p>
	<p>
		This blog is a notebook in which I will store my thoughts and experiments, from the genome parameters that didn't work, through the physics that fought back, to the tech demos built just to prove a point. Not a portfolio of finished things, but a record of trial and error, which brought me here.
	</p>
	<p>
		Currently building an spider evolution sim <em>(name still pending)</em> in Godot, occasionally posting technical breakdowns, and slowly discovering that materials science and gameplay systems design ask a lot of similar questions.
	</p>
	<p>
		<span class="margin-note" style="font-size: 1.8em;">I hope you will have a good time reading through my adventures!</span>
	</p>
</Layout>